- tier (5.5): the table of five rows (an upper row wins when two apply).

The packet: docs/research/2026-10-29-ledger-standard/fields-2026-10-30/reader/packets/gnews_bcd4e6c9e36d405b0efdd18e.json. It holds the article text as the model saw it, its publication_day, publisher and category, and two answers, A and B, from two different versions of the extraction (the order is random). Each answer is the list of records production keeps.

